+## 2. V64.3.32.1 SSIR result
+
+Corrected MEAN cross-fit:
+
+- selected: **476**;
+- selected positive: **260**;
+- precision: **54.62%**;
+- positive-opportunity capture: **45.30%**;
+- selected teacher-improvement sum: **-18.0303795**;
