+
+Mechanism-specific regression coverage
+- incumbent pseudo-item wins non-positive/no-opportunity teacher scenes
+- each scene has total structured pair-loss mass exactly one
+- structured ridge retains fixed lambda=1 without the historical global weight normalization bug
+- zero-preserving pair-gap scoring keeps incumbent runtime score exactly zero
+- RANK/MAIN proposal identity and no-second-best fallback are preserved
+- selected-policy calibrator contributes at most one residual per frozen proposal scene and freezes alpha=0.05
+- contract checker requires exact same RANK selector in MAIN and exact calibration quantile
